{"op":"add","path":"/elements/faq-accordion","value":{"type":"Accordion","props":{"type":"single","items":[{"title":"Is this an outage?","content":"No. This is planned maintenance scheduled during our lowest-traffic window and announced 7 days in advance. Our status page will show \"Under maintenance\", not \"Incident\"."},{"title":"Will I lose any data?","content":"No. All data is backed up before work begins and the upgrade is fully reversible. Nothing in your account changes."},{"title":"What happens to a payment attempted at 03:00 UTC?","content":"It is rejected cleanly before any charge is created. The customer sees a maintenance message and can retry after 06:00 UTC. Duplicate charges are not possible."},{"title":"Why 02:00–06:00 UTC on a Sunday?","content":"It is the quietest four-hour period across all regions we serve, which minimises the number of affected transactions."},{"title":"Could the window be extended?","content":"It is unlikely, but if we need more time we will post an update on the status page and email everyone subscribed to maintenance notices at least 30 minutes before 06:00 UTC."},{"title":"Will I be charged for the downtime?","content":"Scheduled maintenance is excluded from our SLA, but the window is well inside our 99.9% monthly uptime commitment and no credit is required."}]},"children":[]}}
