{"op":"add","path":"/elements/faq","value":{"type":"Accordion","props":{"type":"single","items":[{"title":"Is this an outage?","content":"No. This is planned maintenance that we scheduled and announced in advance. We chose Sunday 02:00–06:00 UTC because it is our lowest-traffic period worldwide."},{"title":"Will payments fail permanently?","content":"No. Payment attempts made during the window are safely queued and processed automatically after 06:00 UTC. Nothing is lost and customers are not double-charged."},{"title":"What happens to a scheduled export?","content":"Scheduled exports and reports due inside the window are deferred, not cancelled. They run automatically once maintenance completes, typically within 30 minutes."},{"title":"Do I need to do anything?","content":"No action is required. If you run large payment batches or nightly exports, consider scheduling them before 01:30 UTC or after 06:30 UTC to avoid a delay."},{"title":"Could the window be extended?","content":"The 06:00 UTC end time includes a one-hour buffer for verification and rollback. If anything changes, we will post an update to the status page and email subscribed contacts."},{"title":"Where can I follow live progress?","content":"Our status page is updated at the start of the window, on completion, and any time the plan changes."}]},"children":[]}}
