{"op":"add","path":"/elements/work-list","value":{"type":"Accordion","props":{"type":"multiple","items":[{"title":"Billing database upgrade","content":"Moving the payments database to a newer engine version with faster writes and improved failover. This requires a short period where no charges can be written, which is why payments pause."},{"title":"Export pipeline rebuild","content":"Replacing the export worker fleet so large CSV and PDF exports finish in seconds instead of minutes. Existing queued exports are preserved and retried after the window."},{"title":"Reliability improvements","content":"Adding a second standby replica in another availability zone, which reduces the chance of unplanned outages in the future."}]},"children":[]}}
