{"op":"add","path":"/elements/faq-accordion","value":{"type":"Accordion","props":{"type":"single","items":[{"title":"Is this an outage?","content":"No. This is scheduled maintenance that we planned in advance and are announcing ahead of time. Only payments and exports are affected, and only during the 02:00–06:00 UTC window on Sunday."},{"title":"Will I lose any data?","content":"No. Nothing is deleted and no transactions are dropped. Payment attempts made during the window are queued and processed automatically once we reopen."},{"title":"What happens to a customer trying to pay during the window?","content":"Checkout pages display a clear message asking them to try again shortly. Card details are never captured in a failed state, so there is no risk of duplicate charges."},{"title":"Do I need to do anything?","content":"No action is required. If you run heavy exports on Sundays, consider starting them before 01:30 UTC or after 06:00 UTC."},{"title":"What if the work runs long?","content":"We will post an update on the status page every 30 minutes past 06:00 UTC until everything is restored, and email admins if the window extends beyond 30 minutes."},{"title":"Can this window be moved?","content":"For enterprise plans with a Sunday-critical workload, contact support before Friday 18:00 UTC and we will look at options for your account."}]},"children":[]}}
