{"op":"add","path":"/elements/faq","value":{"type":"Accordion","props":{"type":"single","items":[{"title":"Is this an outage?","content":"No. This is planned maintenance that we scheduled and announced in advance. We are upgrading our database infrastructure to improve reliability and speed. If an unplanned incident ever occurs, we publish it on our status page and notify you directly."},{"title":"Will I lose any data?","content":"No. All data is backed up before we begin, and this work does not modify your records, settings or integrations."},{"title":"What happens to a payment attempted during the window?","content":"It will be declined with a retryable error rather than partially processed. Retry after 06:00 UTC and it will go through normally. Recurring charges scheduled in the window are automatically retried afterwards."},{"title":"What if maintenance runs long?","content":"Our window allows up to 4 hours, and we usually finish sooner. If we need more time we will post updates every 30 minutes on the status page and email anyone subscribed to notifications."},{"title":"Do I need to tell my own users?","content":"Only if they rely on checkout or exports during those hours. Feel free to reuse the wording on this page."}]},"children":[]}}
