{"op":"add","path":"/elements/faq-accordion","value":{"type":"Accordion","props":{"type":"single","items":[{"title":"Is this an outage?","content":"No. This is planned maintenance that we scheduled and announced in advance. Our status page will show a 'Scheduled maintenance' entry, not an incident."},{"title":"Do I need to do anything?","content":"No action is required. If you routinely run payments or large exports on Sunday mornings, we suggest running them before 02:00 UTC or after 06:00 UTC."},{"title":"What happens to a payment attempted during the window?","content":"It fails cleanly with a retryable error and is never partially processed or double-charged. Automatic retries begin shortly after 06:00 UTC."},{"title":"Will my scheduled exports be lost?","content":"No. Export and report jobs are queued and run automatically once maintenance completes. You will receive them later on Sunday."},{"title":"Could the window be extended?","content":"We expect to finish within the 4-hour window and often finish early. If anything changes, we will post an update on the status page and email subscribers."},{"title":"Is my data at risk?","content":"No. Backups are taken before work begins and every change is reversible. No customer data is modified as part of this maintenance."}]},"children":[]}}
