{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/0","value":{"id":"activate","order":1,"title":"Activate your company account","detail":"Claim your SSO identity so every other tool recognises you.","priority":"Required","badgeVariant":"default","time":"5 min","owner":"Identity team","how":"Open the activation email sent to your personal address, click 'Claim account', then sign in at id.acme.com with the temporary code. Set your display name to match your legal name so payroll and directory stay in sync.","linkLabel":"Account activation walkthrough","href":"https://intranet.acme.com/it/activate","done":true}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/1","value":{"id":"password-manager","order":2,"title":"Install the password manager & set your master password","detail":"1Password is mandatory — never store credentials in the browser.","priority":"Required","badgeVariant":"default","time":"8 min","owner":"Security team","how":"Install 1Password from Self Service (macOS) or Company Portal (Windows). Sign in with your SSO account, create a master password of 14+ characters, then save your Emergency Kit to your personal (non-work) storage. Import nothing from personal vaults.","linkLabel":"Password policy & 1Password setup","href":"https://intranet.acme.com/it/1password","done":false}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/2","value":{"id":"2fa","order":3,"title":"Enrol two-factor authentication (2FA)","detail":"Register a phone authenticator plus one backup method.","priority":"Required","badgeVariant":"default","time":"6 min","owner":"Security team","how":"Go to id.acme.com/security → 'Add method'. Register Okta Verify with push notifications, then add a hardware key or SMS fallback. Download the 10 recovery codes and store them in your 1Password vault, not in Notes or email.","linkLabel":"2FA enrolment guide","href":"https://intranet.acme.com/it/2fa","done":false}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/3","value":{"id":"vpn","order":4,"title":"Configure the VPN client","detail":"Required for internal dashboards, staging, and the wiki off-site.","priority":"Required","badgeVariant":"default","time":"7 min","owner":"Network team","how":"Launch GlobalProtect and enter portal vpn.acme.com. Authenticate with SSO + 2FA. Verify the connection by loading metrics.internal.acme.com. Leave 'Connect on demand' enabled so the tunnel comes up automatically on untrusted Wi-Fi.","linkLabel":"VPN setup and troubleshooting","href":"https://intranet.acme.com/it/vpn","done":false}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/4","value":{"id":"encryption","order":5,"title":"Verify laptop disk encryption","detail":"Confirm FileVault / BitLocker is on and the recovery key escrowed.","priority":"Required","badgeVariant":"default","time":"4 min","owner":"Endpoint team","how":"macOS: System Settings → Privacy & Security → FileVault should read 'On'. Windows: Settings → Device encryption → 'On'. Then open the Jamf/Intune self-service app and run 'Report compliance' so the recovery key is escrowed to IT. Screenshot the green compliance badge for step 8.","linkLabel":"Encryption compliance check","href":"https://intranet.acme.com/it/encryption","done":false}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/5","value":{"id":"os-updates","order":6,"title":"Run pending OS & security updates","detail":"Your laptop must be on the current patch baseline before network access is finalised.","priority":"Required","badgeVariant":"default","time":"15 min","owner":"Endpoint team","how":"Install every pending OS and browser update, then restart. Re-run 'Report compliance' afterwards. Do this while you grab coffee — the restart is the longest part of onboarding.","linkLabel":"Patch baseline requirements","href":"https://intranet.acme.com/it/patching","done":false}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/6","value":{"id":"channels","order":7,"title":"Join your team channels & directory groups","detail":"Slack, calendar groups, and on-call rota for Design Systems.","priority":"Required","badgeVariant":"default","time":"6 min","owner":"Workplace IT","how":"Request the group 'design-systems' in the Access Portal (auto-approved for your role). Then join #design-systems, #design-crit, #it-helpdesk and #acme-announcements in Slack, and accept the recurring standup invite for 09:30.","linkLabel":"Channel & group directory","href":"https://intranet.acme.com/it/channels","done":false}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/7","value":{"id":"backup-profile","order":8,"title":"Set up backups and finish your profile","detail":"Enable cloud backup and add a photo so colleagues can recognise you.","priority":"Recommended","badgeVariant":"secondary","time":"5 min","owner":"Workplace IT","how":"Turn on Drive backup for your Documents and Desktop folders, add a profile photo and pronouns in the directory, and set your Slack timezone. Nice-to-have, but it makes week one much smoother.","linkLabel":"Profile & backup tips","href":"https://intranet.acme.com/it/profile","done":false}}
