{"op":"add","path":"/elements/help-accordion","value":{"type":"Accordion","props":{"type":"single","items":[{"title":"My activation code expired — what now?","content":"Codes expire after 24 hours. Ask your buddy to re-issue one from the Access Portal, or call the helpdesk at ext. 4120. Do not create a second account."},{"title":"2FA push notifications never arrive","content":"Open Okta Verify, pull to refresh, and make sure notifications are allowed in your phone settings. If it still fails, use a recovery code once, then re-enrol the device."},{"title":"VPN connects but internal sites won't load","content":"Disconnect any personal VPN or DNS filter first — they conflict with GlobalProtect. Then flush DNS and reconnect. Persisting? Post in #it-helpdesk with a screenshot of the GlobalProtect status panel."},{"title":"I can't find a channel for my team","content":"Channels are gated by directory group. Request the group in the Access Portal first; Slack membership syncs within about 15 minutes."}]},"children":[]}}
