{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/0","value":{"id":"activate-account","order":1,"title":"Activate your corporate account","action":"I signed into id.northwind.com with my temporary credentials and accepted the acceptable-use policy","detail":"Your account was created as firstname.lastname@northwind.com. Activation unlocks email, calendar and the intranet.","owner":"IT Identity","est":"10 min","tool":"Okta SSO","help":"If the temporary password is rejected, ask your manager to re-trigger the activation email — do not create a second account.","completed":false}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/1","value":{"id":"password-manager","order":2,"title":"Install the password manager","action":"I installed 1Password, joined the company vault and enabled the browser extension","detail":"Every credential that is not behind SSO must live in 1Password. Personal passwords stay in your private vault.","owner":"Security","est":"10 min","tool":"1Password","help":"Use the emailed invite link, not the public sign-up page, or you will end up on a personal plan.","completed":false}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/2","value":{"id":"rotate-password","order":3,"title":"Replace your temporary password","action":"I set a permanent passphrase (16+ characters) generated by 1Password","detail":"Temporary passwords expire after 24 hours. Save the new passphrase to your private vault as you create it.","owner":"You","est":"5 min","tool":"Okta SSO","help":"If the password field rejects your passphrase, check for a trailing space pasted from the generator.","completed":false}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/3","value":{"id":"two-factor","order":4,"title":"Enrol in two-factor authentication","action":"I registered Okta Verify push plus one backup method and stored my recovery codes","detail":"2FA is required for VPN, payroll and production systems. Register a phone and a hardware key if you were issued one.","owner":"Security","est":"15 min","tool":"Okta Verify","help":"Lost your phone mid-setup? The help desk can issue a 24-hour bypass code after a video identity check.","completed":false}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/4","value":{"id":"vpn","order":5,"title":"Install and test the VPN","action":"I connected to GlobalProtect and loaded the internal wiki at wiki.corp","detail":"The VPN is required for anything on *.corp, including the wiki, Jira and the staging environment.","owner":"Network","est":"15 min","tool":"GlobalProtect","help":"A 'certificate not trusted' error usually means step 1 has not finished syncing — wait 10 minutes and retry.","completed":false}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/5","value":{"id":"encryption","order":6,"title":"Verify laptop disk encryption","action":"I confirmed FileVault (macOS) or BitLocker (Windows) shows Encrypted and the recovery key is escrowed","detail":"Open the Jamf or Intune Company Portal and run the Compliance Check — it must report a green Encrypted status.","owner":"Endpoint Ops","est":"10 min","tool":"Jamf / Intune","help":"If encryption is 'in progress', leave the laptop plugged in and re-check after lunch before ticking this box.","completed":false}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/6","value":{"id":"team-channels","order":7,"title":"Join your team channels","action":"I joined #eng-general, my squad channel, #announcements and #it-helpdesk in Slack","detail":"Your manager has been asked to add you to squad-private channels; ping them if you cannot see them by end of day.","owner":"Your manager","est":"10 min","tool":"Slack","help":"Set your display name to 'First Last (Team)' so the directory sync matches you correctly.","completed":false}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/7","value":{"id":"security-training","order":8,"title":"Finish security awareness training","action":"I completed the 20-minute phishing and data-handling module and passed the quiz","detail":"Required within your first week for compliance. You will get a certificate email to keep for the audit trail.","owner":"Compliance","est":"20 min","tool":"KnowBe4","help":"The module needs the VPN off — disconnect GlobalProtect if the video will not play.","completed":false}
