{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/0","value":{"id":"s1","number":1,"title":"Activate your company account","detail":"Claim your SSO identity and set your permanent password.","instructions":"Go to id.acme-corp.com/activate, enter your employee ID (shown on your welcome card) and the 6-digit code texted to you. Choose a password of at least 14 characters. This single login unlocks email, Slack, and the HR portal.","minutes":10,"tool":"Okta SSO","linkLabel":"Open activation portal","linkHref":"https://id.acme-corp.com/activate","done":true}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/1","value":{"id":"s2","number":2,"title":"Enroll in 2-factor authentication","detail":"Required before you can access any internal system.","instructions":"Install Okta Verify on your phone, then scan the QR code shown after activation. Register a hardware key or your phone's biometrics as a backup factor, and save the 10 recovery codes in your password manager once Step 3 is done.","minutes":10,"tool":"Okta Verify","linkLabel":"2FA setup guide","linkHref":"https://wiki.acme-corp.com/it/2fa","done":true}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/2","value":{"id":"s3","number":3,"title":"Set up the password manager","detail":"1Password is mandatory for all work credentials.","instructions":"Accept the 1Password invite in your inbox, install the desktop app and browser extension, then print or photograph your Emergency Kit and store it somewhere offline. Never keep work passwords in your browser or a personal vault.","minutes":10,"tool":"1Password","linkLabel":"Download 1Password","linkHref":"https://acme-corp.1password.com","done":false}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/3","value":{"id":"s4","number":4,"title":"Verify laptop disk encryption","detail":"Confirm FileVault / BitLocker is on and the key is escrowed.","instructions":"macOS: System Settings → Privacy & Security → FileVault should read 'On'. Windows: run 'manage-bde -status' in an admin terminal and confirm 'Percentage Encrypted: 100%'. Then open the Jamf or Intune Self Service app and click 'Check compliance' so the recovery key is escrowed to IT.","minutes":8,"tool":"Jamf / Intune","linkLabel":"Encryption verification steps","linkHref":"https://wiki.acme-corp.com/it/encryption","done":false}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/4","value":{"id":"s5","number":5,"title":"Install and test the VPN","detail":"Needed for staging environments and internal dashboards.","instructions":"Install GlobalProtect from Self Service, sign in with SSO at vpn.acme-corp.com, and approve the 2FA prompt. Confirm success by loading metrics.internal — it should render without a certificate warning. Split tunnelling is enabled, so only internal traffic is routed.","minutes":10,"tool":"GlobalProtect","linkLabel":"VPN troubleshooting","linkHref":"https://wiki.acme-corp.com/it/vpn","done":false}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/5","value":{"id":"s6","number":6,"title":"Join your team channels","detail":"Slack channels and email groups for Platform Engineering.","instructions":"In Slack, join #platform-eng, #platform-oncall, #deploys, and #new-hires. Accept the calendar invite for the Monday 10:00 standup, and confirm you now receive mail sent to platform-eng@acme-corp.com.","minutes":5,"tool":"Slack","linkLabel":"Open Slack workspace","linkHref":"https://acme-corp.slack.com","done":false}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/6","value":{"id":"s7","number":7,"title":"Request code and tooling access","detail":"GitHub, CI, and cloud read access via the access portal.","instructions":"Submit the 'Engineer baseline' access bundle in the IT portal. Your manager approves it, usually within an hour. It grants GitHub org membership, Buildkite, Datadog read, and sandbox AWS credentials.","minutes":7,"tool":"Access Portal","linkLabel":"Request access bundle","linkHref":"https://access.acme-corp.com/bundles/engineer","done":false}}
{"op":"add","path":"/state/steps/7","value":{"id":"s8","number":8,"title":"Complete the security acknowledgement","detail":"Sign the acceptable-use and data-handling policy.","instructions":"Finish the 12-minute security awareness module in the learning portal and e-sign the Acceptable Use Policy. Compliance blocks production access until this is recorded, so don't leave it for week two.","minutes":15,"tool":"Learning Portal","linkLabel":"Start security module","linkHref":"https://learn.acme-corp.com/security-101","done":false}}
