{"op":"add","path":"/elements/faq-card","value":{"type":"Card","props":{"title":"Common first-day snags","description":"Check here before opening a ticket."},"children":["faq-accordion"]}}
{"op":"add","path":"/elements/faq-accordion","value":{"type":"Accordion","props":{"type":"single","items":[{"title":"My activation code expired","content":"Codes are valid for 24 hours. Reply 'RESEND' to the activation text, or ask the IT Helpdesk to reissue one — you'll need photo ID on video call."},{"title":"2FA push notifications never arrive","content":"Open Okta Verify manually and use the 6-digit code instead. Then check that notifications are enabled for the app and that your phone clock is set to automatic time."},{"title":"FileVault shows 'Encrypting…' not 'On'","content":"That's normal on a freshly imaged laptop. Leave it plugged in for 30–45 minutes and re-check. Only escalate if the percentage hasn't moved in an hour."},{"title":"VPN connects but internal sites fail","content":"Disconnect, quit GlobalProtect fully, reconnect, and flush DNS. If metrics.internal still fails, you're likely missing the access bundle from Step 7."},{"title":"I can't find my team's Slack channels","content":"Private channels won't appear in search. Ask your IT buddy or manager to add you directly — they're listed in the support panel below."}]},"children":[]}}
