## Validation notes

- **Component allowlist**: only `Column`, `Row`, `Card`, `Divider`, `Text`, `Icon`, `TextField`, `Button` — all catalog-defined.
- **Horizontal children**: single `Row` (`header_row`) has exactly 2 children ✓
- **Card shell**: one `Card` only; `icon_chip` uses background + radius but no shadow, so it is a color block, not a nested shell ✓
- **Real CTA**: `Button` + `action.event` with a visible `Text` label ✓ — no fake buttons.
- **CTA integrity**: `align-self: stretch` + 36px horizontal padding guarantees "Send message" stays on one line ✓
- **Font scale**: 36 / 32 / 28 / 24 only ✓
- **Text styles**: `color`, `font-size`, `line-height`, `line-clamp`, `text-align` applied to `Text` components only ✓
- **Units**: all sizes in `px`; `padding`/`margin` shorthand always four values ✓
- **Binding**: all dynamic values use `{"path": "..."}` with `/` separators; no dot notation; no hard-coded business text in `updateComponents` ✓
- **No fabricated image URLs** — visual accent uses a built-in `Icon` ✓

**Note**: `Icon` accepts only `name` plus common styles (no `color` style, which is `Text`-only), so the mail glyph renders in the runtime's default icon color. The `#EEF2FF` chip behind it supplies the accent tint.

