{"op":"add","path":"/state/recommendation","value":{"provider":"Amazon Web Services (AWS)","summary":"Best default for most organizations that need the widest service portfolio, mature operational tooling, global capacity, and the least architectural compromise as requirements grow.","why":"AWS is the safest all-round choice when you have mixed workloads: regulated systems, containers, analytics, serverless, AI, disaster recovery, and global expansion. Its trade-off is complexity: use landing-zone standards, FinOps guardrails, and managed services to control it."}}
